Package: monitor.legislativo
Type: Package
Title: R SDK for Brazilian Legislative Monitoring API
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-09-10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Monitor Legislativo", "Research Team", 
           email = "api-support@monitor-legislativo.br", 
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sofia", "Donario", 
           email = "sofia@monitor-legislativo.br", 
           role = "aut")
    )
Description: Comprehensive R SDK for seamless integration with the Brazilian Legislative 
    Monitoring API. Provides high-level functions for accessing, analyzing, and exporting 
    Brazilian legislative data for academic research. Features include document search, 
    geographic analysis, citation generation, and advanced analytics tools optimized for 
    R workflows and the tidyverse ecosystem.
